\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Final-answer accuracy by condition and model. Checksum critique produces a large gain for claude-haiku-4.5, a statistically null effect for gpt-4o-mini, and a catastrophic collapse for llama-3.1-8b-instruct, revealing a non-monotonic rather than smoothly diminishing relationship between baseline capability and checksum-critique benefit.}}{8}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:fig2}{{2}{8}{Final-answer accuracy by condition and model. Checksum critique produces a large gain for claude-haiku-4.5, a statistically null effect for gpt-4o-mini, and a catastrophic collapse for llama-3.1-8b-instruct, revealing a non-monotonic rather than smoothly diminishing relationship between baseline capability and checksum-critique benefit}{figure.2}{}}
